T*
(= d^2y/dx^2.) Tj
T*
(* Parametric Formula \(x = x\(t\), y = y\(t\)\): rho = [ \(x'\)^2 + \(y'\)^2 ]^{3/2} / | x'*y'') Tj
T*
(- y'*x'' |.) Tj
